config BR2_PACKAGE_SOAPY_MU_CELL
    bool "soapy-mu-cell"
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_SOAPY_SDR
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_OPENSSL
    depends on BR2_INSTALL_LIBSTDCPP
    depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
    help
      SoapySDR driver plugin for the µCell BB HAT (SX1255-based
      baseband board). Builds the SoapyMuCell shared module and
      installs it into SoapySDR's module search path so that
      SoapySDRUtil --find and Python/C++ SoapySDR bindings can
      discover the µCell device at runtime.

      Source: https://github.com/Jankyneering/mu-cell-bb-drivers